-------------------------------------------
This has not been reviewed by a lawyer, and nothing here is legal advice.

AGPL-3.0 obligations attach on distribution, including network distribution.
While Conjure is private and internal, this is not a live question. It becomes
one the moment Conjure is published, shipped as a product, sold, or exposed as
